# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Palma Pool Club — single repository.
#
# The Next.js app lives in site/. On Vercel, set Root Directory = site.
# site/.gitignore still applies inside that folder (node_modules, .next,
# screenshots), so this file only covers the research material at the root.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Abandoned Stitch mockups — 36 MB of AI-generated stock imagery and
# Material-3 markup that this project explicitly does not use. Kept on disk
# for reference, deliberately not versioned.
/stitch_exported/

# Base64 duplicates of files already in selected/
/selected/b64/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DELIBERATELY VERSIONED, despite being large — do not add these to ignore:
#   *.png, *.jpg at root   the ONLY copies of the venue's photography
#   selected/              menu and price cards, source of truth for all
#                          typed pricing and menu content
#   instagram_raw/         35 scraped posts, source of every Serbian sentence
#   refs/                  competitor reference screenshots
# Losing any of these means losing content that cannot be reconstructed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ui-ux-pro-max skill installation — a TOOL, not project content.
# Regenerate with:  npm i -g ui-ux-pro-max-cli && uipro init --ai claude
# (run from the repo root; it writes .claude/skills/)
# The generated design system IS versioned, at site/design-system/.
/.claude/
